## Complete DevSecOps project architecture

 Build a **microservices application on AWS EKS** with **GitHub Actions for CI** and **Argo CD for GitOps CD**. Use Terraform for infrastructure, ECR for images, Helm/Kustomize for Kubernetes manifests, and security gates throughout CI/CD.

```
Developer
   │
   ▼
GitHub ── Pull Request
   │
   ├── SAST ─────────────── SonarQube
   ├── Secrets ──────────── Gitleaks
   ├── Dependency Scan ──── Trivy / Dependabot
   ├── IaC Scan ─────────── Checkov
   └── Tests
          │
          ▼
   GitHub Actions CI
          │
          ├── Docker Build
          ├── Trivy Image Scan
          ├── SBOM
          └── Push image
                │
                ▼
             AWS ECR
                │
                ▼
      Update GitOps Repository
                │
                ▼
          Argo CD detects
             Git change
                │
                ▼
          AWS EKS Cluster
        ┌───────┴────────┐
        │                │
     Dev/Staging       Prod
        │                │
        └───────┬────────┘
                ▼
       Prometheus/Grafana
       CloudWatch / Alerts
```

